1
00:00:49,758 --> 00:00:50,717
‎"Truth be told,

2
00:00:51,301 --> 00:00:52,469
‎I was ashamed."

3
00:00:55,180 --> 00:00:57,182
‎"Each time your fervent touch

4
00:00:58,266 --> 00:01:00,060
‎fell upon my body,

5
00:01:01,728 --> 00:01:04,314
‎heat seemed to rise in every part of me,

6
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:06,816
‎and my body would writhe with it."

7
00:01:08,193 --> 00:01:09,444
‎"And for that,

8
00:01:10,987 --> 00:01:12,489
‎I was deeply ashamed of myself."

9
00:01:14,908 --> 00:01:16,534
‎"I was in pain as well."

10
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:20,622
‎"When you filled me completely…

11
00:01:22,957 --> 00:01:26,419
‎the pain of flesh being parted
‎left me nearly senseless."

12
00:01:28,797 --> 00:01:29,839
‎"Yet…"

13
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:35,929
‎"The moment I felt you moving inside me,

14
00:01:37,722 --> 00:01:39,265
‎I finally realized."

15
00:01:44,270 --> 00:01:47,690
‎"I wish to spend all the countless nights
‎ahead of me with you,

16
00:01:48,775 --> 00:01:51,027
‎and live so for the rest of my life."

17
00:01:56,616 --> 00:01:57,450
‎"Please

18
00:01:58,451 --> 00:02:00,620
‎stay by my side, just as you do now."

19
00:02:14,008 --> 00:02:16,553
‎What a pitiful woman indeed.

20
00:02:19,889 --> 00:02:22,100
‎And all the more amusing for it.

21
00:02:24,561 --> 00:02:28,022
‎So then, how was it for you?

22
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:32,402
‎Did the sight of that swooning widow

23
00:02:34,195 --> 00:02:35,405
‎stir your blood?

24
00:02:36,948 --> 00:02:39,200
‎When that woman, knowing nothing of men…

25
00:02:43,121 --> 00:02:44,664
‎clung to my neck

26
00:02:46,541 --> 00:02:48,001
‎and looked at me with pleading eyes…

27
00:02:55,425 --> 00:02:56,759
‎I found it all so warm.

28
00:02:58,344 --> 00:02:59,721
‎Did you now?

29
00:03:04,767 --> 00:03:06,352
‎Are you displeased?

30
00:03:07,061 --> 00:03:08,229
‎And if I am?

31
00:03:09,606 --> 00:03:11,691
‎Surely you know.

32
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:14,152
‎The only reason I have gone this far…

33
00:03:16,237 --> 00:03:17,989
‎is all because of you.

34
00:03:21,743 --> 00:03:22,744
‎Now, then.

35
00:03:26,372 --> 00:03:27,790
‎Is tonight the night?

36
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:34,422
‎It is what I have long awaited.

37
00:04:13,253 --> 00:04:14,754
‎I'm afraid

38
00:04:14,837 --> 00:04:16,714
‎I will have to postpone

39
00:04:17,590 --> 00:04:19,384
‎your reward a little longer.

40
00:04:20,677 --> 00:04:23,596
‎I was in the midst of something
‎far more important.

41
00:04:47,787 --> 00:04:48,913
‎Wait, what…

42
00:04:51,874 --> 00:04:53,126
‎What is this?

43
00:04:53,209 --> 00:04:56,963
‎I hear you have been ordered
‎to recover the widow's body.

44
00:04:57,046 --> 00:05:00,341
‎Since you have been occupied
‎with this wretched wager of ours,

45
00:05:00,425 --> 00:05:02,427
‎I thought I'd write it for you.

46
00:05:03,928 --> 00:05:08,266
‎Though I never imagined
‎her desire to live had grown so strong.

47
00:05:10,768 --> 00:05:13,896
‎It seems she has gone back
‎on our agreement.

48
00:05:14,522 --> 00:05:15,565
‎Agreement?

49
00:05:17,275 --> 00:05:19,068
‎When I wrote
‎that marriage proposal for her,

50
00:05:19,777 --> 00:05:21,612
‎she made me a promise.

51
00:05:24,532 --> 00:05:27,076
‎That she would accept death
‎when the time came,

52
00:05:27,952 --> 00:05:30,413
‎to fulfill her final duty
‎at the very least.

53
00:05:32,415 --> 00:05:34,042
‎It is only proper, is it not?

54
00:05:35,335 --> 00:05:38,880
‎That is how her story ought to end.

55
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:43,926
‎It is unfortunate that she still lives,

56
00:05:44,469 --> 00:05:46,179
‎but it matters not.

57
00:05:47,805 --> 00:05:48,765
‎In the end,

58
00:05:50,475 --> 00:05:51,976
‎she shall meet that fate.

59
00:05:53,895 --> 00:05:56,105
‎All you need to do
‎is take what I have written

60
00:05:56,606 --> 00:05:58,649
‎and present it to His Majesty.

61
00:05:59,692 --> 00:06:01,152
‎Tell him

62
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:03,488
‎that someone

63
00:06:04,447 --> 00:06:06,449
‎claims to have witnessed
‎the dreadful sight

64
00:06:07,075 --> 00:06:09,035
‎of a woman casting herself from a cliff.

65
00:06:09,118 --> 00:06:12,872
‎So you would have me report a lie?

66
00:06:12,955 --> 00:06:16,167
‎Once the news reaches the widow,

67
00:06:17,418 --> 00:06:19,128
‎there will be nothing she can do.

68
00:06:20,088 --> 00:06:21,339
‎She will accept her fate

69
00:06:22,298 --> 00:06:23,633
‎and take her own life.

70
00:06:24,217 --> 00:06:28,137
‎Then everything may return
‎to its proper place.

71
00:06:29,764 --> 00:06:32,475
‎Your concern for me may be
‎as vast as the heavens,

72
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:35,645
‎but your kindness

73
00:06:36,479 --> 00:06:38,314
‎has gone too far, Cousin!

74
00:06:39,649 --> 00:06:40,691
‎This?

75
00:06:42,068 --> 00:06:44,904
‎This is not something
‎you should meddle in.

76
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,322
‎Meddle?

77
00:06:48,116 --> 00:06:49,033
‎Cousin.

78
00:06:50,827 --> 00:06:52,703
‎Do you remember the day…

79
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:58,126
‎you became the pride of the family
‎with the verse I wrote for you?

80
00:07:00,378 --> 00:07:03,256
‎I am only trying to help you now,
‎as I did then.

81
00:07:06,926 --> 00:07:08,970
‎I remember it all too clearly.

82
00:07:09,762 --> 00:07:12,890
‎How could I ever forget
‎those piercing eyes fixed upon me?

83
00:07:15,476 --> 00:07:17,061
‎If I could…

84
00:07:20,898 --> 00:07:22,984
‎If I could return to that day,

85
00:07:23,067 --> 00:07:25,236
‎I would tell them the verse

86
00:07:25,319 --> 00:07:27,488
‎was never mine to begin with, but yours.

87
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:30,491
‎I am not…

88
00:07:36,038 --> 00:07:38,207
‎I am not that boy anymore.

89
00:07:46,382 --> 00:07:48,426
‎-Won.
‎-Do not call me that.

90
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:50,470
‎You say you wrote this

91
00:07:50,553 --> 00:07:52,388
‎to help me, just as you did then?

92
00:07:54,807 --> 00:07:55,892
‎Very well.

93
00:07:56,809 --> 00:07:57,727
‎Fine!

94
00:07:59,437 --> 00:08:01,606
‎Then let me ask you once more,
‎as I did back then.

95
00:08:03,232 --> 00:08:04,901
‎Will you take my hand…

96
00:08:08,946 --> 00:08:10,740
‎and come with me this time?

97
00:08:41,938 --> 00:08:42,897
‎At last…

98
00:08:46,317 --> 00:08:48,361
‎those are the words I have longed to hear.

99
00:08:52,823 --> 00:08:54,325
‎I have been waiting.

100
00:08:56,118 --> 00:08:58,162
‎For you to ask me to leave with you again.

101
00:09:01,624 --> 00:09:04,085
‎Ever since the day
‎I failed to come to you,

102
00:09:04,961 --> 00:09:06,587
‎it has never left my mind.

103
00:09:08,422 --> 00:09:10,466
‎I wondered
‎where the boat I sent away in tears

104
00:09:11,592 --> 00:09:13,511
‎had drifted by now…

105
00:09:16,472 --> 00:09:19,475
‎and whether I might ever find it again.

106
00:09:23,312 --> 00:09:25,064
‎So tell me more.

107
00:09:26,816 --> 00:09:29,151
‎Tell me of the future you imagined for us.

108
00:09:32,113 --> 00:09:34,156
‎Let me hear it now, if it is not too late.

109
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:40,663
‎How about Yanjing, the city said to hold

110
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:43,374
‎all the world's wonders?

111
00:09:45,126 --> 00:09:46,002
‎Well?

112
00:10:21,203 --> 00:10:22,330
‎Cho Won.

113
00:10:29,545 --> 00:10:31,130
‎Cho Won.

114
00:10:38,679 --> 00:10:41,307
‎I wanted to call you by your name.

115
00:10:51,984 --> 00:10:52,943
‎Hui-yeon.

116
00:10:58,074 --> 00:10:59,075
‎Hui-yeon.

117
00:11:10,211 --> 00:11:15,925
‎THE SCANDAL

118
00:11:47,915 --> 00:11:48,749
‎My lady.

119
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:55,631
‎Young Master In-ho came by.

120
00:11:58,467 --> 00:12:02,138
‎He saw me again
‎outside the gate just moments ago.

121
00:12:13,023 --> 00:12:15,734
‎My lord, I do not care where we go.

122
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:20,865
‎Would you leave with me?

123
00:12:23,242 --> 00:12:24,618
‎Please come away with me.

124
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:37,006
‎It is all right.

125
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:40,509
‎Hearing you say that,

126
00:12:40,593 --> 00:12:42,052
‎I find myself

127
00:12:43,512 --> 00:12:44,972
‎foolishly happy.

128
00:12:49,393 --> 00:12:50,728
‎All right, then.

129
00:12:51,729 --> 00:12:52,897
‎Where shall we go?

130
00:12:54,565 --> 00:12:55,566
‎Across the sea…

131
00:12:55,649 --> 00:12:56,484
‎No.

132
00:12:58,194 --> 00:13:01,780
‎Perhaps, all the way to Yanjing,
‎where no one will ever find us…

133
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:14,919
‎I have been waiting.

134
00:13:15,753 --> 00:13:17,421
‎For you to ask me to leave with you again.

135
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:19,173
‎I do not care where.

136
00:13:20,132 --> 00:13:22,134
‎How about Yanjing, the city said to hold

137
00:13:23,552 --> 00:13:25,262
‎all the world's wonders?

138
00:13:27,014 --> 00:13:27,848
‎Well?

139
00:13:39,068 --> 00:13:40,277
‎I have been waiting.

140
00:13:46,909 --> 00:13:48,577
‎I have been waiting to hear those words.

141
00:13:54,083 --> 00:13:55,626
‎Tell me more.

142
00:13:57,586 --> 00:13:58,420
‎Tell me

143
00:14:00,339 --> 00:14:01,298
‎of our future.

144
00:14:31,328 --> 00:14:33,038
‎There is something you must know.

145
00:14:33,789 --> 00:14:35,583
‎His Majesty has given me a command.

146
00:14:36,125 --> 00:14:38,669
‎He said the Left State Councilor's
‎daughter-in-law passed away…

147
00:14:41,005 --> 00:14:43,507
‎and I am to recover her body.

148
00:14:46,302 --> 00:14:47,469
‎I will

149
00:14:49,305 --> 00:14:51,140
‎find a way somehow.

150
00:14:52,683 --> 00:14:54,226
‎So you should leave first.

151
00:14:55,561 --> 00:14:57,021
‎No, I will not.

152
00:14:57,521 --> 00:14:59,398
‎Did you not say you wished to live?

153
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:16,373
‎I do wish to live.

154
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,046
‎I wish to live with you, my lord.

155
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:29,845
‎That cannot be.

156
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:55,537
‎Truth be told, I have come to ask a favor.

157
00:15:56,288 --> 00:15:58,874
‎I was hoping
‎you might have work for someone.

158
00:15:58,958 --> 00:16:00,209
‎For whom?

159
00:16:00,292 --> 00:16:02,419
‎-A woman.
‎-A woman?

160
00:16:02,503 --> 00:16:04,088
‎A woman dressed as a man.

161
00:16:13,138 --> 00:16:14,306
‎Young master.

162
00:16:14,390 --> 00:16:16,517
‎Do get up.
‎I have brought you some porridge--

163
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,185
‎My head aches terribly.

164
00:16:19,478 --> 00:16:20,688
‎Your head?

165
00:16:20,771 --> 00:16:22,398
‎Oh, In-ho.

166
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:26,777
‎What has come over you?

167
00:16:37,663 --> 00:16:39,415
‎I said I would not eat,
‎so why do you keep…

168
00:16:57,933 --> 00:17:00,019
‎I never knew
‎you were capable of such impropriety.

169
00:17:01,395 --> 00:17:03,480
‎I wish I had known sooner.

170
00:17:10,612 --> 00:17:13,032
‎You are hardly in a position to laugh.

171
00:17:17,619 --> 00:17:19,913
‎The girl who is to become
‎my brother-in-law's concubine…

172
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:24,918
‎asked me to deliver this.

173
00:17:30,382 --> 00:17:32,217
‎I never knew either.

174
00:17:32,301 --> 00:17:34,970
‎That you had such a lust for women.

175
00:17:35,763 --> 00:17:37,181
‎Had I known sooner…

176
00:17:39,475 --> 00:17:42,561
‎I would have given my cousin fair warning.

177
00:17:44,730 --> 00:17:48,192
‎I wonder
‎what your father would make of it.

178
00:17:58,077 --> 00:17:58,952
‎What…

179
00:18:04,958 --> 00:18:05,793
‎Master.

180
00:18:05,876 --> 00:18:07,044
‎Come now, young master.

181
00:18:08,462 --> 00:18:10,839
‎There's no need for this between us.

182
00:18:16,095 --> 00:18:17,471
‎You need not worry.

183
00:18:17,554 --> 00:18:19,848
‎I shall not tell a soul.

184
00:18:19,932 --> 00:18:23,685
‎It is the duty of a gentleman
‎to protect his family's honor, is it not?

185
00:18:25,312 --> 00:18:26,522
‎But you see,

186
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:31,110
‎some things, once brought to light,
‎cannot be contained.

187
00:19:53,442 --> 00:19:55,360
‎You said you were

188
00:19:56,445 --> 00:19:57,821
‎no longer that boy.

189
00:20:00,741 --> 00:20:02,451
‎And yet,

190
00:20:03,744 --> 00:20:06,330
‎when you asked me
‎to leave with you once more,

191
00:20:08,248 --> 00:20:09,249
‎I felt as though

192
00:20:10,250 --> 00:20:13,003
‎I had met that sweet young man
‎from my youth again.

193
00:20:15,047 --> 00:20:17,007
‎It made my whole body tremble.

194
00:20:28,435 --> 00:20:31,647
‎So then, did you go to Hwaseong?

195
00:20:31,730 --> 00:20:35,525
‎You went to see things through
‎with the widow, I trust?

196
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:37,444
‎Yes.

197
00:20:41,114 --> 00:20:44,409
‎If you were only going to return
‎to your rightful place in the end,

198
00:20:45,994 --> 00:20:48,914
‎there was no need
‎for that foolish wager at all.

199
00:20:50,958 --> 00:20:54,211
‎So, what became of the widow?

200
00:20:54,878 --> 00:20:56,964
‎Did she part from you easily enough?

201
00:21:02,636 --> 00:21:05,639
‎She seemed to have
‎neither attachment nor strength left.

202
00:21:09,226 --> 00:21:10,936
‎She will take her own life.

203
00:21:15,148 --> 00:21:16,108
‎Soon, I imagine.

204
00:21:19,778 --> 00:21:20,821
‎I see.

205
00:21:23,448 --> 00:21:25,951
‎Perhaps we should count that as a mercy.

206
00:21:27,995 --> 00:21:29,788
‎But there is a problem.

207
00:21:31,123 --> 00:21:34,334
‎I do not know how,
‎but the Left State Councilor's son…

208
00:21:36,795 --> 00:21:38,505
‎seemed to know everything.

209
00:21:39,131 --> 00:21:41,049
‎Young Master In-ho should be fine.

210
00:21:42,217 --> 00:21:43,927
‎He is too soft-hearted

211
00:21:44,428 --> 00:21:46,346
‎to let it slip.

212
00:21:48,640 --> 00:21:49,683
‎The real problem is

213
00:21:51,393 --> 00:21:53,270
‎the Lady of the First Rank.

214
00:21:54,813 --> 00:21:55,814
‎She knows.

215
00:21:57,316 --> 00:21:59,151
‎I should have told you this first,

216
00:21:59,651 --> 00:22:02,738
‎but I feared it would
‎only cause you needless worry.

217
00:22:03,322 --> 00:22:07,409
‎As long as she can secure
‎a Memorial Gate for her daughter-in-law,

218
00:22:07,909 --> 00:22:10,037
‎she will turn a blind eye
‎to everything else.

219
00:22:10,120 --> 00:22:12,539
‎She said she must be granted one.

220
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:14,958
‎That was her only request.

221
00:22:15,584 --> 00:22:17,252
‎Did she threaten you?

222
00:22:20,756 --> 00:22:23,633
‎She asked a favor of me.

223
00:22:23,717 --> 00:22:25,635
‎-Cousin.
‎-Please tell His Majesty

224
00:22:26,386 --> 00:22:29,139
‎exactly what I wrote for you.

225
00:22:29,222 --> 00:22:30,932
‎That is all you need to do.

226
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:34,144
‎Then no one and nothing

227
00:22:34,227 --> 00:22:37,230
‎will trouble you and me ever again.

228
00:22:42,527 --> 00:22:43,361
‎All right.

229
00:22:54,748 --> 00:22:57,542
‎I was keeping this
‎to show you when you came.

230
00:22:58,710 --> 00:22:59,586
‎Here.

231
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:02,923
‎This is you, is it not?

232
00:23:04,508 --> 00:23:07,761
‎THERE WAS A MAN WHO WENT ABOUT
‎SCOLDING WOMEN'S SECRET PLACES…

233
00:23:16,228 --> 00:23:17,312
‎Where…

234
00:23:19,147 --> 00:23:20,315
‎did you get this?

235
00:23:20,398 --> 00:23:22,984
‎Eun-sil's mistress ordered it burned,

236
00:23:23,068 --> 00:23:25,570
‎but the women working there
‎were passing it around in secret.

237
00:23:26,196 --> 00:23:28,824
‎My dear Eun-sil
‎thought you ought to see it,

238
00:23:28,907 --> 00:23:32,077
‎so she traded her precious jerky for it.

239
00:23:34,162 --> 00:23:35,163
‎Oh, Bun-hui.

240
00:23:35,247 --> 00:23:36,081
‎"Oh, Bun-hui"?

241
00:23:37,249 --> 00:23:38,583
‎-Bun-hui…
‎-Bun-hui?

242
00:23:48,009 --> 00:23:50,011
‎Run an errand for me.
‎Go to Mapo Ferry Crossing.

243
00:23:51,763 --> 00:23:52,889
‎We are leaving for Yanjing.

244
00:23:53,515 --> 00:23:54,432
‎Yanjing?

245
00:23:54,516 --> 00:23:55,684
‎The Great State?

246
00:23:56,476 --> 00:23:57,727
‎Whether by sea or by land,

247
00:23:59,062 --> 00:24:01,148
‎find the fastest route
‎that will not draw attention.

248
00:24:01,731 --> 00:24:02,649
‎And…

249
00:24:05,652 --> 00:24:07,946
‎it must be suitable for a woman
‎to make the journey.

250
00:24:08,530 --> 00:24:10,824
‎A woman? Who have you gone and found now?

251
00:24:10,907 --> 00:24:11,783
‎What about Eun-sil?

252
00:24:13,118 --> 00:24:14,619
‎You'd leave her behind?

253
00:24:15,829 --> 00:24:17,205
‎Eun-sil…

254
00:24:17,289 --> 00:24:19,749
‎Eun-sil is going to Yanjing too?

255
00:24:19,833 --> 00:24:20,750
‎Really?

256
00:24:21,418 --> 00:24:22,669
‎I have somewhere to go.

257
00:24:23,378 --> 00:24:25,463
‎-Make sure you find out all you can.
‎-Yes.

258
00:24:36,474 --> 00:24:37,434
‎Cousin.

259
00:24:40,270 --> 00:24:41,771
‎Are you heading out somewhere?

260
00:24:52,490 --> 00:24:54,743
‎Should I not be making preparations
‎for our departure?

261
00:24:57,746 --> 00:25:01,374
‎Then when do you intend
‎to see His Majesty?

262
00:25:05,462 --> 00:25:06,504
‎I shall make haste.

263
00:25:11,593 --> 00:25:15,472
‎If you tie it so loosely,
‎it will come undone at once.

264
00:25:20,435 --> 00:25:22,062
‎It must be tied firmly.

265
00:25:25,482 --> 00:25:26,524
‎There.

266
00:25:27,692 --> 00:25:28,652
‎Off you go now.

267
00:25:35,116 --> 00:25:35,951
‎All right.

268
00:26:12,654 --> 00:26:13,655
‎Young master.

269
00:26:16,283 --> 00:26:17,117
‎What is the matter?

270
00:26:22,080 --> 00:26:24,207
‎I stepped out for a short while.

271
00:26:24,291 --> 00:26:26,209
‎By the time I returned,
‎she had already left.

272
00:26:27,627 --> 00:26:29,129
‎Forgive me, young master.

273
00:26:29,212 --> 00:26:30,422
‎No.

274
00:26:31,464 --> 00:26:32,757
‎The fault is mine.

275
00:26:36,136 --> 00:26:37,137
‎Oh, dear.

276
00:26:44,519 --> 00:26:47,188
‎So, when is your mother expected back?

277
00:26:47,272 --> 00:26:48,523
‎To tell the truth,

278
00:26:49,232 --> 00:26:51,901
‎I do not believe
‎she can see you today, madam.

279
00:26:53,737 --> 00:26:57,073
‎She went to Mapo Ferry Crossing to receive
‎a shipment of tobacco from Qing,

280
00:26:57,157 --> 00:26:59,451
‎and she insists on
‎inspecting everything herself.

281
00:27:00,410 --> 00:27:03,163
‎I expect she will not be back
‎until near sundown.

282
00:27:04,539 --> 00:27:05,665
‎Is that so?

283
00:27:05,749 --> 00:27:06,875
‎Yes, madam.

284
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:11,421
‎There is a matter
‎I entrusted to your mother,

285
00:27:11,504 --> 00:27:14,758
‎yet I have heard nothing of it,
‎which is why I came myself.

286
00:27:16,968 --> 00:27:19,346
‎Perhaps if I had spoken more kindly,

287
00:27:20,263 --> 00:27:23,058
‎she might have understood me better
‎and been quicker about it.

288
00:27:23,767 --> 00:27:27,187
‎I do not care to repeat myself.

289
00:27:30,315 --> 00:27:32,150
‎So I shall not say it a third time.

290
00:27:32,734 --> 00:27:34,277
‎I shall grant you a fortnight's grace.

291
00:27:34,903 --> 00:27:36,279
‎Collect every last one of them.

292
00:27:39,657 --> 00:27:42,410
‎My reputation and standing
‎were not built overnight,

293
00:27:42,994 --> 00:27:45,914
‎and I cannot afford
‎to let this stain spread any further.

294
00:27:50,627 --> 00:27:51,836
‎Do pass that along to her.

295
00:27:54,881 --> 00:27:55,924
‎Yes, madam.

296
00:28:01,137 --> 00:28:03,390
‎Who does she think she is?

297
00:28:04,015 --> 00:28:07,519
‎Once So-ok is with child,
‎she will be shoved into a back room!

298
00:28:07,602 --> 00:28:09,020
‎Unbelievable.

299
00:28:09,771 --> 00:28:11,022
‎How dare she?

300
00:28:11,731 --> 00:28:13,608
‎Mother, are you all right?

301
00:28:13,691 --> 00:28:17,195
‎Do I look all right?
‎I'm fit to burst with rage!

302
00:28:17,278 --> 00:28:18,405
‎But Mother,

303
00:28:19,197 --> 00:28:22,242
‎you are at your most beautiful
‎when you are angry.

304
00:28:27,622 --> 00:28:28,581
‎For heaven's sake!

305
00:28:29,541 --> 00:28:31,418
‎You blithering idiot.

306
00:28:32,043 --> 00:28:33,336
‎Good grief.

307
00:28:34,712 --> 00:28:37,257
‎I'm furious. So furious!

308
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:47,183
‎Excuse me!

309
00:28:47,267 --> 00:28:48,727
‎This is a forgery, is it not?

310
00:28:50,103 --> 00:28:52,939
‎Who cares whether a dirty picture
‎is genuine or forged?

311
00:28:53,022 --> 00:28:55,108
‎As long as it's titillating.

312
00:28:55,191 --> 00:28:57,694
‎This painting you've been collecting?

313
00:28:58,778 --> 00:29:02,532
‎The entire city of Hanyang
‎is flooded with exact copies of it.

314
00:29:03,116 --> 00:29:04,367
‎Not just one or two.

315
00:29:04,451 --> 00:29:05,577
‎At least dozens…

316
00:29:06,161 --> 00:29:08,580
‎No, there may well be hundreds by now.

317
00:29:09,289 --> 00:29:11,040
‎It may take you some time.

318
00:29:19,132 --> 00:29:22,177
‎Before His Lordship returns,
‎have the servants…

319
00:29:28,433 --> 00:29:29,267
‎Madam?

320
00:29:33,813 --> 00:29:34,647
‎Gye-hwa.

321
00:29:35,732 --> 00:29:36,649
‎Yes, madam.

322
00:29:37,358 --> 00:29:39,903
‎Send So-ok and the servants
‎out of the house,

323
00:29:40,528 --> 00:29:41,696
‎then bar the front gate.

324
00:29:43,364 --> 00:29:45,366
‎Yes, I will.

325
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:52,957
‎Come along, all of you.

326
00:29:55,502 --> 00:29:57,170
‎Has my cousin not returned yet?

327
00:29:57,253 --> 00:29:58,880
‎No, he has not.

328
00:29:58,963 --> 00:30:00,548
‎Tell me the moment he does.

329
00:30:00,632 --> 00:30:01,508
‎Yes.

330
00:30:02,509 --> 00:30:03,468
‎Hurry.

331
00:30:32,121 --> 00:30:34,207
‎I must say, this is rather bold of you.

332
00:30:35,917 --> 00:30:38,336
‎For someone who claimed to know
‎she must depart with honor,

333
00:30:39,379 --> 00:30:41,631
‎what possessed you to come here?

334
00:30:42,757 --> 00:30:44,008
‎I am deeply ashamed.

335
00:30:52,767 --> 00:30:54,227
‎Go on, then. Explain yourself.

336
00:30:55,562 --> 00:30:59,190
‎What brings you to me in such a state?

337
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:07,490
‎Please persuade Lord Cho.

338
00:31:07,991 --> 00:31:09,492
‎What do you mean?

339
00:31:12,245 --> 00:31:13,246
‎He said

340
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:18,960
‎he had been ordered to recover my body.

341
00:31:22,797 --> 00:31:24,340
‎He said he would find a way

342
00:31:25,884 --> 00:31:27,927
‎and urged me to flee first.

343
00:31:34,142 --> 00:31:35,143
‎He

344
00:31:36,477 --> 00:31:37,729
‎said that?

345
00:31:39,647 --> 00:31:41,900
‎He told me to go somewhere

346
00:31:43,234 --> 00:31:45,403
‎no one would ever find us.

347
00:31:50,992 --> 00:31:52,577
‎But if he reports

348
00:31:53,328 --> 00:31:56,289
‎a falsehood because of me,
‎his life will be at risk.

349
00:31:59,292 --> 00:32:01,920
‎I cannot leave him behind
‎and flee on my own.

350
00:32:09,052 --> 00:32:11,721
‎If you are so worried for his life…

351
00:32:14,057 --> 00:32:16,893
‎then why not make the lie the truth?

352
00:32:28,821 --> 00:32:29,781
‎My lord.

353
00:32:29,864 --> 00:32:31,032
‎Has something happened?

354
00:32:32,033 --> 00:32:32,867
‎What is the matter?

355
00:32:34,786 --> 00:32:36,579
‎Now that you have come to know love,

356
00:32:37,372 --> 00:32:39,040
‎are you afraid to die?

357
00:32:40,541 --> 00:32:44,253
‎Do you no longer care
‎for the chastity and family honor

358
00:32:45,588 --> 00:32:47,465
‎you were so determined to protect?

359
00:32:50,635 --> 00:32:51,678
‎Lady An.

360
00:32:52,512 --> 00:32:56,099
‎If your love is strong enough
‎to save a man who ought to die,

361
00:32:57,517 --> 00:33:00,186
‎why can you not act yourself?

362
00:33:01,062 --> 00:33:03,064
‎Why come to me
‎instead of doing it yourself?

363
00:33:03,940 --> 00:33:05,858
‎I cannot understand it.

364
00:33:10,363 --> 00:33:11,948
‎It is cowardly of you.

365
00:33:18,413 --> 00:33:19,414
‎I know.

366
00:33:24,377 --> 00:33:26,629
‎But this was the only place

367
00:33:27,422 --> 00:33:28,881
‎I could think to come.

368
00:33:30,675 --> 00:33:31,801
‎Did you not…

369
00:33:34,512 --> 00:33:36,139
‎confide your secret to me

370
00:33:36,681 --> 00:33:38,766
‎and offer me your friendship?

371
00:33:38,850 --> 00:33:40,476
‎Did you just

372
00:33:41,394 --> 00:33:42,812
‎invoke my secret?

373
00:33:44,731 --> 00:33:46,232
‎I beg of you.

374
00:33:47,400 --> 00:33:50,028
‎Just persuade him.

375
00:33:50,903 --> 00:33:52,572
‎Tell him he must not go to His Majesty.

376
00:33:54,449 --> 00:33:55,366
‎Madam!

377
00:33:56,117 --> 00:33:57,577
‎Madam! Lord Cho Won has…

378
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:22,393
‎Why are you here?

379
00:34:23,519 --> 00:34:25,229
‎I came to ask for help.

380
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:29,609
‎I cannot leave you behind.

381
00:34:39,827 --> 00:34:41,120
‎I beg you, madam.

382
00:34:41,621 --> 00:34:45,374
‎Please tell him
‎he must not go to His Majesty.

383
00:34:45,458 --> 00:34:47,168
‎Tell him to leave with me.

384
00:34:59,138 --> 00:35:02,809
‎Since you are so desperate,
‎I have no choice but to oblige.

385
00:35:12,652 --> 00:35:14,278
‎I shall help

386
00:35:15,279 --> 00:35:16,697
‎the two of you leave.

387
00:35:17,824 --> 00:35:20,034
‎I am not without compassion.

388
00:35:21,994 --> 00:35:22,829
‎But first…

389
00:35:25,581 --> 00:35:28,292
‎I would like to hear it from you, Cousin.

390
00:35:29,210 --> 00:35:31,170
‎What is it that you want?

391
00:35:33,548 --> 00:35:34,715
‎Do you

392
00:35:35,424 --> 00:35:37,552
‎truly wish to leave with her?

393
00:35:50,106 --> 00:35:52,358
‎Tell her you will leave with me.

394
00:35:56,154 --> 00:35:56,988
‎Could I…

395
00:36:03,870 --> 00:36:05,621
‎Could I ever leave?

396
00:36:06,914 --> 00:36:07,832
‎My lord.

397
00:36:11,752 --> 00:36:13,296
‎I tried to break free…

398
00:36:16,632 --> 00:36:19,260
‎yet the heart I left behind
‎only grows clearer.

399
00:36:21,554 --> 00:36:24,307
‎I felt the same after you left.

400
00:36:26,350 --> 00:36:27,643
‎That is what it means to love.

401
00:36:33,566 --> 00:36:34,525
‎Yes.

402
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:39,113
‎There is someone I love.

403
00:37:16,359 --> 00:37:17,193
‎My lord.

404
00:37:20,279 --> 00:37:22,865
‎Can you not simply come with me?

405
00:37:26,327 --> 00:37:28,579
‎Do you not love me?

406
00:38:05,241 --> 00:38:07,076
‎What will you do now?

407
00:38:08,577 --> 00:38:11,080
‎Will you make the lie the truth

408
00:38:11,163 --> 00:38:13,416
‎to save him from danger?

409
00:38:14,250 --> 00:38:15,584
‎Or will you leave this place

410
00:38:16,294 --> 00:38:18,587
‎and live quietly as though you were dead?

411
00:38:19,547 --> 00:38:21,257
‎If you wish,

412
00:38:21,340 --> 00:38:24,135
‎I shall find a way
‎for you to live on your own.

413
00:38:26,178 --> 00:38:27,305
‎Choose.

414
00:38:35,313 --> 00:38:36,480
‎My lord.

415
00:39:33,662 --> 00:39:34,580
‎Do you

416
00:39:36,540 --> 00:39:37,917
‎love her?

417
00:39:40,336 --> 00:39:41,420
‎Love?

418
00:39:44,507 --> 00:39:49,178
‎When she begged me to leave with her…

419
00:39:55,226 --> 00:39:57,144
‎I truly meant to go.

420
00:39:58,646 --> 00:39:59,688
‎Cousin.

421
00:39:59,772 --> 00:40:02,733
‎It pained me because I saw myself in her,
‎clinging to you.

422
00:40:04,568 --> 00:40:05,736
‎But in that moment,

423
00:40:06,529 --> 00:40:08,614
‎I realized something with perfect clarity.

424
00:40:11,283 --> 00:40:12,284
‎That you

425
00:40:14,286 --> 00:40:16,622
‎never intended to leave with me.

426
00:40:20,084 --> 00:40:22,044
‎Because I could not leave with her,

427
00:40:22,670 --> 00:40:25,214
‎I spoke of nothing but impossible dreams.

428
00:40:27,925 --> 00:40:30,344
‎"Shall we cross the sea or go to Yanjing?"

429
00:40:32,888 --> 00:40:34,849
‎Once I stood in your place, I understood.

430
00:40:38,185 --> 00:40:41,063
‎You never intended to leave with me
‎from the beginning.

431
00:40:49,697 --> 00:40:51,031
‎I was terrified…

432
00:40:58,038 --> 00:40:59,540
‎of being abandoned.

433
00:41:01,584 --> 00:41:02,668
‎And you think I love her?

434
00:41:20,394 --> 00:41:21,979
‎You know as well as I do…

435
00:41:24,273 --> 00:41:26,442
‎that our bond

436
00:41:26,525 --> 00:41:28,152
‎can never be severed.

437
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:30,404
‎As we agreed,

438
00:41:31,530 --> 00:41:33,407
‎tell His Majesty about the widow…

439
00:41:35,493 --> 00:41:36,410
‎and please…

440
00:41:38,037 --> 00:41:40,164
‎Please come back to me.

441
00:41:48,130 --> 00:41:51,509
‎I want to know
‎the look on His Majesty's face

442
00:41:52,510 --> 00:41:54,929
‎when he reads what I wrote,
‎every word he says.

443
00:41:55,930 --> 00:41:57,014
‎I want to hear

444
00:41:57,973 --> 00:41:59,058
‎everything.

445
00:42:03,562 --> 00:42:04,396
‎Please?

446
00:42:06,315 --> 00:42:08,067
‎You will do that for me, won't you?

447
00:42:30,464 --> 00:42:32,049
‎If that is what you wish…

448
00:42:38,305 --> 00:42:39,515
‎that is what I shall do.

449
00:43:50,085 --> 00:43:52,212
‎Why did you come to me…

450
00:43:55,841 --> 00:43:58,427
‎when your heart
‎already belonged to another?

451
00:44:02,681 --> 00:44:04,933
‎I made a wager over your chastity.

452
00:44:07,853 --> 00:44:09,772
‎If I could claim your body and heart,

453
00:44:14,234 --> 00:44:17,655
‎I would have a chance to win
‎the woman I had longed for all my life.

454
00:44:21,075 --> 00:44:24,370
‎I had no reason to refuse such a wager.

455
00:44:27,539 --> 00:44:29,041
‎Do you mean to say…

456
00:44:33,212 --> 00:44:35,381
‎you humiliated an innocent woman
‎to win another?

457
00:44:39,176 --> 00:44:40,594
‎That is the truth.

458
00:44:46,809 --> 00:44:48,060
‎How vile of you.

459
00:44:55,567 --> 00:44:57,486
‎So? Did you win her?

460
00:44:59,655 --> 00:45:00,489
‎No.

461
00:45:01,740 --> 00:45:02,616
‎Why not?

462
00:45:03,909 --> 00:45:05,702
‎After all you have put me through,

463
00:45:07,579 --> 00:45:09,498
‎you should have.

464
00:45:28,767 --> 00:45:30,727
‎We are near
‎the Left State Councilor's residence.

465
00:45:31,770 --> 00:45:33,188
‎I fear

466
00:45:34,356 --> 00:45:35,524
‎someone may recognize you.

467
00:45:55,878 --> 00:45:58,338
‎I will ask no further favor of you.

468
00:46:00,424 --> 00:46:02,009
‎Please do not die.

469
00:46:03,051 --> 00:46:04,470
‎Live well.

470
00:46:08,557 --> 00:46:11,518
‎I resent you bitterly.

471
00:46:20,611 --> 00:46:22,404
‎And by that exact same measure…

472
00:46:34,082 --> 00:46:35,959
‎I shall live on.

473
00:48:51,219 --> 00:48:53,972
‎Cheong, come in.

474
00:48:57,059 --> 00:49:00,896
‎I wish to make myself beautiful.

475
00:49:34,638 --> 00:49:37,224
‎You are capable of writing
‎something proper after all.

476
00:49:38,892 --> 00:49:41,478
‎So the body was never recovered.

477
00:49:42,688 --> 00:49:44,189
‎Yet as I read this,

478
00:49:44,856 --> 00:49:47,818
‎I can see before me
‎a death so dignified, so heartbreaking.

479
00:49:49,111 --> 00:49:52,280
‎Now, tell me more about the witness.

480
00:49:53,031 --> 00:49:54,658
‎The Left State Councilor should hear it.

481
00:50:01,957 --> 00:50:05,836
‎It was a papermaker who witnessed
‎the moment she took her life.

482
00:50:05,919 --> 00:50:08,088
‎He supplies paper
‎for the Hwaseong construction works.

483
00:50:08,839 --> 00:50:10,799
‎By his account,

484
00:50:12,676 --> 00:50:14,845
‎it was at dawn,
‎after days of relentless rain,

485
00:50:14,928 --> 00:50:17,347
‎when floodwaters
‎were rushing below the cliff.

486
00:50:18,682 --> 00:50:21,810
‎As he drew water and looked up,

487
00:50:21,893 --> 00:50:25,397
‎he saw a noblewoman weeping bitterly.

488
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:27,107
‎But in the blink of an eye,

489
00:50:27,816 --> 00:50:29,234
‎the woman

490
00:50:30,402 --> 00:50:32,028
‎had thrown herself from the cliff.

491
00:50:36,283 --> 00:50:40,245
‎Though the swollen river carried her away
‎and she could not be found,

492
00:50:41,037 --> 00:50:44,332
‎the date matches the day
‎the Councilor's daughter-in-law's brother

493
00:50:44,416 --> 00:50:45,792
‎began searching for her body.

494
00:50:46,376 --> 00:50:47,252
‎As such,

495
00:50:50,172 --> 00:50:52,340
‎it could only have been her.

496
00:50:56,762 --> 00:50:57,804
‎Your Majesty,

497
00:50:57,888 --> 00:50:58,889
‎all of this

498
00:50:59,806 --> 00:51:02,476
‎is due to my own failing.

499
00:51:02,559 --> 00:51:05,312
‎I beg you, do not grant the Memorial Gate.

500
00:51:05,395 --> 00:51:06,480
‎No.

501
00:51:07,272 --> 00:51:10,025
‎Who could hope to stop a raging storm?

502
00:51:11,443 --> 00:51:12,903
‎Hear me, Left State Councilor.

503
00:51:12,986 --> 00:51:14,279
‎The Memorial Gate is granted.

504
00:51:15,405 --> 00:51:16,740
‎It is time you accepted it.

505
00:51:22,829 --> 00:51:25,665
‎Your grace knows no bounds, Your Majesty.

506
00:51:26,208 --> 00:51:28,502
‎-Your grace knows no bounds.
‎-Your grace knows no bounds.

507
00:51:43,475 --> 00:51:45,769
‎I merely carried out
‎the command I was given.

508
00:51:58,573 --> 00:51:59,741
‎Cho Won, stop there.

509
00:52:02,911 --> 00:52:03,745
‎Come with me.

510
00:52:11,503 --> 00:52:13,505
‎I consider this construction

511
00:52:14,297 --> 00:52:17,342
‎the most important undertaking of my life.

512
00:52:17,425 --> 00:52:21,179
‎That is why,
‎though I am confined to the palace,

513
00:52:21,805 --> 00:52:24,349
‎I receive daily secret reports

514
00:52:25,141 --> 00:52:26,935
‎from dozens of officials besides you

515
00:52:27,018 --> 00:52:30,272
‎on the conditions throughout Hwaseong.

516
00:52:31,189 --> 00:52:33,608
‎On the day before the widow
‎cast herself from the cliff,

517
00:52:35,402 --> 00:52:38,071
‎only a light drizzle fell in Hwaseong.

518
00:52:42,742 --> 00:52:44,077
‎Now, tell me.

519
00:52:47,163 --> 00:52:50,500
‎Knowing full well that such a trifling lie
‎could never deceive me,

520
00:52:51,668 --> 00:52:52,878
‎why did you tell it?

521
00:53:07,642 --> 00:53:09,311
‎Do you dare remain silent

522
00:53:09,895 --> 00:53:12,731
‎because there is something you'd protect
‎even at the cost of your life?

523
00:53:16,151 --> 00:53:18,028
‎You have not changed at all.

524
00:53:18,945 --> 00:53:21,448
‎Always speaking without a thought
‎for the consequences.

525
00:53:23,116 --> 00:53:24,117
‎And yet,

526
00:53:24,784 --> 00:53:27,120
‎I always envied that about you.

527
00:53:28,371 --> 00:53:31,917
‎I have never been able to live as myself,
‎not even for a moment.

528
00:53:33,668 --> 00:53:36,504
‎I've always had to live as someone's son,
‎under the late king's shadow.

529
00:53:37,714 --> 00:53:40,926
‎So I envied how freely
‎you spread your wings and flew,

530
00:53:41,760 --> 00:53:42,844
‎untethered.

531
00:53:46,765 --> 00:53:49,059
‎That is why
‎I held you in such special regard.

532
00:53:50,185 --> 00:53:51,853
‎I kept an unworthy man by my side,

533
00:53:51,937 --> 00:53:53,897
‎sending him to do the things I could not,

534
00:53:54,856 --> 00:53:56,733
‎hoping he would become
‎my most trusted man.

535
00:53:57,776 --> 00:53:58,652
‎Your Majesty.

536
00:54:02,238 --> 00:54:03,907
‎Forgive my boldness.

537
00:54:06,451 --> 00:54:07,577
‎But in truth…

538
00:54:11,456 --> 00:54:13,375
‎I am but a bird trapped in a cage…

539
00:54:15,961 --> 00:54:17,796
‎one that has never flown.

540
00:54:26,262 --> 00:54:28,098
‎Hear me, Cho Won.

541
00:54:30,475 --> 00:54:32,852
‎For the crime of daring
‎to deceive your sovereign,

542
00:54:32,936 --> 00:54:35,313
‎I shall end the friendship between us.

543
00:54:35,814 --> 00:54:36,773
‎Never again

544
00:54:37,816 --> 00:54:40,402
‎shall you stand before me like this.

545
00:55:37,250 --> 00:55:40,003
‎His Majesty
‎was deeply moved by your writing.

546
00:55:41,504 --> 00:55:43,798
‎The death it portrayed was so vivid that,

547
00:55:43,882 --> 00:55:45,592
‎more than the gravity
‎of the Memorial Gate,

548
00:55:45,675 --> 00:55:48,053
‎he seemed to feel the sorrow
‎of losing one of his people

549
00:55:48,136 --> 00:55:50,555
‎and could not conceal his grief.

550
00:55:51,765 --> 00:55:52,682
‎As a result,

551
00:55:53,475 --> 00:55:55,935
‎a Memorial Gate will be erected
‎for the Councilor's family.

552
00:55:56,019 --> 00:55:58,229
‎Thank you for bringing me
‎such a precious letter.

553
00:55:58,813 --> 00:55:59,856
‎Of course, madam.

554
00:56:00,899 --> 00:56:02,150
‎Gye-hwa, are you there?

555
00:56:02,233 --> 00:56:04,360
‎-Prepare drinks and refreshments.
‎-Yes, madam.

556
00:56:04,444 --> 00:56:05,570
‎When my cousin arrives…

557
00:56:07,238 --> 00:56:08,156
‎Never mind.

558
00:56:08,698 --> 00:56:10,116
‎I shall go out and wait for him.

559
00:56:25,465 --> 00:56:26,758
‎You arrived right on time.

560
00:56:26,841 --> 00:56:27,675
‎Wait.

561
00:56:28,968 --> 00:56:30,095
‎Is it just you, sir?

562
00:56:30,178 --> 00:56:31,471
‎I came to take you across myself

563
00:56:31,554 --> 00:56:33,765
‎because I was told
‎you'd be traveling with a woman.

564
00:56:34,599 --> 00:56:35,767
‎Well, things changed.

565
00:56:40,480 --> 00:56:43,316
‎I'll pay the full fare, so let us be off.

566
00:56:45,318 --> 00:56:46,861
‎Very well.

567
00:56:53,493 --> 00:56:54,327
‎All right, then.

568
00:56:55,745 --> 00:56:57,163
‎Off we go!

569
00:58:03,021 --> 00:58:05,064
‎What takes you to Yanjing?

570
00:58:05,648 --> 00:58:09,360
‎It does not seem like
‎you are going there to pursue scholarship.

571
00:58:13,490 --> 00:58:14,824
‎Sharp-eyed, are you?

572
00:58:16,534 --> 00:58:20,413
‎You are not fleeing after committing
‎some grave crime, are you?

573
00:58:21,122 --> 00:58:22,707
‎That would get me in trouble.

574
00:58:26,085 --> 00:58:27,712
‎I spent my days chasing women…

575
00:58:30,048 --> 00:58:32,926
‎and now two of them are after me.

576
00:58:34,010 --> 00:58:35,220
‎Quite the predicament.

577
00:58:37,847 --> 00:58:39,724
‎I am making a midnight escape.

578
00:58:42,143 --> 00:58:43,937
‎Well, only two?

579
00:58:45,021 --> 00:58:47,941
‎I'd be happy with three or four!

580
00:58:54,781 --> 00:58:57,825
‎If you say the word,
‎I shall turn the boat around.

581
00:58:58,701 --> 00:59:01,871
‎You do not look much like a man
‎who truly wishes to run away.

582
00:59:03,164 --> 00:59:06,417
‎If we turn back now,
‎I'll only charge half the fare.

583
00:59:10,838 --> 00:59:12,882
‎Return to whom?

584
00:59:32,735 --> 00:59:33,820
‎My lord?

585
00:59:34,737 --> 00:59:35,572
‎My lord!

586
00:59:36,155 --> 00:59:37,156
‎Good heavens!

587
00:59:41,911 --> 00:59:42,870
‎My lord!

588
00:59:47,375 --> 00:59:48,376
‎My lord!

589
01:00:09,105 --> 01:00:10,273
‎Damn it!

590
01:00:10,773 --> 01:00:12,984
‎Do you know how hard it is
‎to be born a nobleman?

591
01:00:13,901 --> 01:00:14,777
‎For heaven's sake!

592
01:00:15,570 --> 01:00:16,779
‎Damn it!

593
01:00:56,110 --> 01:00:58,613
‎Mister, I'm heading to Hanyang
‎with a delivery.

594
01:00:59,155 --> 01:01:00,657
‎-Right.
‎-I'll go with him.

595
01:01:00,740 --> 01:01:02,408
‎I packed some snacks for the road.

596
01:01:02,492 --> 01:01:05,286
‎Keep your eyes open while you're there.

597
01:01:05,370 --> 01:01:06,788
‎Who knows?

598
01:01:06,871 --> 01:01:08,956
‎You might find Lord Cho Won somewhere.

599
01:01:11,000 --> 01:01:13,795
‎What would I even do
‎with that heartless nobleman?

600
01:01:13,878 --> 01:01:15,755
‎You fool.

601
01:01:16,464 --> 01:01:18,716
‎Who do you think got you your freedom,

602
01:01:18,800 --> 01:01:20,093
‎paid for Eun-sil's as well,

603
01:01:20,176 --> 01:01:22,720
‎and even asked me
‎to help you make a living?

604
01:01:22,804 --> 01:01:24,055
‎That's no way to speak of him.

605
01:01:26,140 --> 01:01:27,433
‎I'm just upset.

606
01:01:29,519 --> 01:01:30,978
‎Is he dead or alive?

607
01:01:31,979 --> 01:01:33,815
‎If he's alive,
‎he could at least send word.

608
01:01:37,443 --> 01:01:39,904
‎All right, enough. Off with you now.

609
01:01:40,988 --> 01:01:41,823
‎I'm off.

610
01:01:47,829 --> 01:01:50,915
‎Thank you for bringing
‎such fine paper every time.

611
01:01:51,499 --> 01:01:54,252
‎I picked out only the best of the best.

612
01:01:54,961 --> 01:01:57,422
‎I'm glad you like them.

613
01:01:58,339 --> 01:02:00,216
‎And how is the work?

614
01:02:00,299 --> 01:02:01,592
‎It is not too hard, I hope?

615
01:02:03,136 --> 01:02:05,304
‎Not at all.
‎I'm finally living a decent life.

616
01:02:06,180 --> 01:02:07,473
‎I just hope my lord…

617
01:02:14,313 --> 01:02:16,941
‎If you'll excuse me,
‎I'd best be on my way.

618
01:02:33,207 --> 01:02:34,459
‎I will deliver it,

619
01:02:35,752 --> 01:02:37,712
‎but you never get a reply, so why…

620
01:02:37,795 --> 01:02:38,838
‎I appreciate it.

621
01:02:42,675 --> 01:02:45,553
‎I heard we have
‎a new sister joining us today.

622
01:02:45,636 --> 01:02:48,681
‎We've had quite a few new sisters
‎joining us lately.

623
01:02:48,765 --> 01:02:49,849
‎That's good news.

624
01:02:50,641 --> 01:02:52,143
‎She should be here by now.

625
01:02:55,563 --> 01:02:56,731
‎There she is.

626
01:03:04,739 --> 01:03:05,948
‎Oh, you can sit over there.

627
01:03:07,241 --> 01:03:08,242
‎Welcome.

628
01:03:08,326 --> 01:03:09,535
‎My apologies.

629
01:03:09,619 --> 01:03:12,079
‎It's my first time,
‎and I seem to have arrived late.

630
01:03:13,873 --> 01:03:16,459
‎Now that we are all gathered,
‎let us begin.

631
01:03:18,628 --> 01:03:20,963
‎When one makes a vow before the Lord,

632
01:03:21,464 --> 01:03:24,467
‎it must accord with
‎what is right and true.

633
01:03:26,677 --> 01:03:30,014
‎They need more candles
‎for all the new sisters.

634
01:03:30,097 --> 01:03:33,392
‎-I see.
‎-…one dishonors and insults the Lord.

635
01:03:33,976 --> 01:03:37,522
‎Therefore,
‎we must never forsake the truth.

636
01:03:38,648 --> 01:03:40,066
‎Isn't that only natural?

637
01:03:40,149 --> 01:03:42,568
‎It is no good living by lies.

638
01:03:44,195 --> 01:03:45,112
‎Indeed.

639
01:03:45,613 --> 01:03:47,698
‎I'm right, aren't I?

640
01:03:47,782 --> 01:03:48,658
‎Yes.

641
01:03:49,659 --> 01:03:50,952
‎Let us continue.

642
01:03:52,995 --> 01:03:56,249
‎Even if one does not invoke
‎the holy name of the Lord,

643
01:03:57,083 --> 01:04:01,420
‎the sin is the same as if one had.

644
01:04:02,839 --> 01:04:05,925
‎Heaven and earth and all things

645
01:04:06,759 --> 01:04:10,721
‎were created by the Lord for mankind…

646
01:04:10,805 --> 01:04:12,890
‎What's wrong? Why did you not go in?

647
01:04:14,016 --> 01:04:15,059
‎Are you leaving already?

648
01:04:18,646 --> 01:04:20,565
‎I'm afraid I cannot stay today.

649
01:04:22,358 --> 01:04:23,359
‎Please take these.

650
01:04:23,442 --> 01:04:26,237
‎…and ever give thanks for His grace.

651
01:04:27,488 --> 01:04:32,034
‎Therefore, Holy Mother Church
‎has set apart one day in every seven,

652
01:04:32,660 --> 01:04:34,078
‎calling it the Lord's Day…

653
01:05:07,486 --> 01:05:09,697
‎Time passes

654
01:05:10,948 --> 01:05:13,034
‎Flowers bloom

655
01:05:15,202 --> 01:05:18,080
‎Bees and butterflies

656
01:05:18,164 --> 01:05:19,123
‎Oh, young master!

657
01:05:19,206 --> 01:05:20,541
‎Fly in

658
01:05:20,625 --> 01:05:23,836
‎Such is the order of nature

659
01:05:23,920 --> 01:05:25,504
‎Though nature's order

660
01:05:26,297 --> 01:05:28,466
‎Does not always follow what is right

661
01:05:28,549 --> 01:05:32,511
‎Wait, what nonsense is that?
‎Nature's order not being right?

662
01:05:32,595 --> 01:05:36,182
‎Plant soybeans, get soybeans
‎Plant red beans, get red beans

663
01:05:36,682 --> 01:05:39,393
‎Even a three-year-old knows

664
01:05:39,477 --> 01:05:43,522
‎That is the order of nature

665
01:05:43,606 --> 01:05:47,777
‎You might as well tell me

666
01:05:47,860 --> 01:05:53,157
‎That dignified Lady of the First Rank
‎Started hurling her bolster about

667
01:05:53,240 --> 01:05:56,285
‎Now that, I'd call nonsense

668
01:05:56,369 --> 01:05:59,789
‎Though this crying sounds rather serious

669
01:06:01,040 --> 01:06:02,249
‎Good heavens!

670
01:06:02,333 --> 01:06:04,293
‎-Well, would you look at that
‎-Mother…

671
01:06:06,837 --> 01:06:09,048
‎She still has plenty of fight left in her

672
01:06:09,131 --> 01:06:12,635
‎Even the Buddha himself
‎Couldn't withstand such fury

673
01:06:12,718 --> 01:06:15,554
‎Indeed, blessed are those who endure

674
01:06:15,638 --> 01:06:18,224
‎Tap-tap on the wooden fish

675
01:06:18,307 --> 01:06:20,768
‎A handsome little red bean from next door

676
01:06:20,851 --> 01:06:23,145
‎Fell into a soybean patch

677
01:06:23,229 --> 01:06:25,481
‎And got itself all tangled up in it

678
01:06:25,564 --> 01:06:30,069
‎Yet the noble folk of Bukchon
‎Pretend not to notice

679
01:06:30,152 --> 01:06:33,489
‎Drunk on wine, drunk on power

680
01:06:33,572 --> 01:06:35,074
‎They say

681
01:06:35,157 --> 01:06:38,285
‎"Isn't it a pleasure to study
‎and practice what you have learned?"

682
01:06:38,369 --> 01:06:40,037
‎Where on earth is it?

683
01:06:40,788 --> 01:06:42,873
‎May as well lift a leg while you're at it

684
01:06:42,957 --> 01:06:45,292
‎What they are studying or practicing,
‎I couldn't say

685
01:06:45,376 --> 01:06:51,048
‎But they certainly seem like
‎They are taking pleasure in it

686
01:06:51,841 --> 01:06:57,013
‎The hawk moth that once fed on
‎The nectar of white gourd blossoms

687
01:06:57,096 --> 01:07:02,977
‎Has done its part
‎And gone back to where it came from

688
01:07:03,060 --> 01:07:07,398
‎Spring has come again

689
01:07:07,481 --> 01:07:09,316
‎But why won't it sprout?

690
01:07:09,400 --> 01:07:11,861
‎Black beans, chickpeas
‎Cranberry beans, peas

691
01:07:11,944 --> 01:07:14,613
‎Kidney beans, soybeans
‎Beans, beans, beans

692
01:07:14,697 --> 01:07:16,782
‎What kind of bean did they plant
‎That it won't sprout?

693
01:07:16,866 --> 01:07:18,743
‎Do you need to ask?

694
01:07:18,826 --> 01:07:23,664
‎An old dried-up bean
‎That's been sitting around for years

695
01:07:23,748 --> 01:07:26,584
‎Rotten thorough

696
01:07:26,667 --> 01:07:29,920
‎And hollow inside

697
01:07:30,004 --> 01:07:31,756
‎But look, it did sprout

698
01:07:31,839 --> 01:07:34,550
‎So it wasn't supposed to sprout,
‎Yet it did?

699
01:07:34,633 --> 01:07:36,927
‎That means
‎Everything worked out, does it not?

700
01:07:37,011 --> 01:07:38,929
‎Did you even watch from Episode 1?

701
01:07:39,013 --> 01:07:43,559
‎Stop talking nonsense
‎And go watch it again

702
01:07:43,642 --> 01:07:46,270
‎The sprout came from the wrong bean

703
01:07:46,353 --> 01:07:50,900
‎Boy, if it came from the wrong bean
‎Things have gone seriously wrong

704
01:07:50,983 --> 01:07:52,568
‎-This is a matter of propriety
‎-My lady!

705
01:07:52,651 --> 01:07:55,029
‎-If nature cannot be helped
‎-This way!

706
01:07:55,112 --> 01:07:56,864
‎Then one should at least do what's right

707
01:07:56,947 --> 01:08:00,910
‎What's right, you say? Propriety?

708
01:08:00,993 --> 01:08:02,369
‎What about it?

709
01:08:02,453 --> 01:08:04,830
‎Can you not see? It's gone to the dogs

710
01:08:05,873 --> 01:08:10,628
‎Good grief, speak of the devil
‎Certainly more devil than noble, that one

711
01:08:10,711 --> 01:08:14,381
‎Honestly, has she no shame?
‎Look at her

712
01:08:14,465 --> 01:08:17,259
‎Staring him right in the face

713
01:08:17,343 --> 01:08:20,429
‎Come now, they say a mother-in-law
‎Always dotes on her son-in-law

714
01:08:20,513 --> 01:08:21,889
‎Indeed

715
01:08:21,972 --> 01:08:25,142
‎Those cut from the same cloth
‎Always close ranks

716
01:08:25,226 --> 01:08:28,437
‎Blood runs thicker than water

717
01:08:28,521 --> 01:08:31,690
‎Like attracts like
‎Thick as thieves

718
01:08:31,774 --> 01:08:33,859
‎Birds of a feather do flock together

719
01:08:34,985 --> 01:08:38,072
‎"Noble," they call them

720
01:08:38,155 --> 01:08:41,283
‎More title than substance

721
01:08:41,367 --> 01:08:44,370
‎The sprout may not have come
‎From a soybean after all

722
01:08:44,453 --> 01:08:47,498
‎But more likely a red bean

723
01:08:47,581 --> 01:08:50,626
‎Yet they sit there all prim and proper

724
01:08:50,709 --> 01:08:54,588
‎While raging inside

725
01:08:54,672 --> 01:08:58,008
‎They tried so hard to keep it quiet

726
01:08:59,176 --> 01:09:02,847
‎Yet whispers spread everywhere

727
01:09:02,930 --> 01:09:06,725
‎Murmur, murmur
‎This, that, and the other

728
01:09:06,809 --> 01:09:11,564
‎Thanks to the wagging tongues
‎Of the Bukchon ladies

729
01:09:11,647 --> 01:09:13,858
‎Everyone who ought to know already knows

730
01:09:13,941 --> 01:09:16,318
‎Everyone except His Lordship, apparently

731
01:09:16,402 --> 01:09:18,612
‎Surely he does not know
‎No, he must not

732
01:09:18,696 --> 01:09:21,031
‎If he did

733
01:09:21,115 --> 01:09:25,244
‎How could he act that way?

734
01:09:26,203 --> 01:09:29,665
‎Come now, after all this time?

735
01:09:30,541 --> 01:09:32,960
‎You still don't know the Bukchon nobles?

736
01:09:33,043 --> 01:09:37,089
‎They know perfectly well
‎And pretend otherwise

737
01:09:37,923 --> 01:09:41,886
‎Well, well, with so many ladies
‎More talented than any clown

738
01:09:41,969 --> 01:09:44,305
‎Gathered right here

739
01:09:44,388 --> 01:09:47,349
‎I'm so intimidated my voice is giving out

740
01:09:47,892 --> 01:09:51,312
‎I shall take my leave now
‎And head down to Namchon

741
01:09:52,021 --> 01:09:53,230
‎Truth be told

742
01:09:53,314 --> 01:09:56,400
‎I'm scared out of my wits,
‎So I'm making my escape

743
01:09:58,986 --> 01:10:01,155
‎Run along, then

744
01:10:45,574 --> 01:10:46,617
‎In this bitter cold…

745
01:10:48,994 --> 01:10:51,538
‎you have come all this way again?

746
01:10:52,248 --> 01:10:55,000
‎The fact that someone
‎is still sending him letters…

747
01:10:58,921 --> 01:11:00,714
‎means I am not the only one

748
01:11:02,007 --> 01:11:04,426
‎who believes he is still alive,
‎does it not?

749
01:11:04,510 --> 01:11:06,512
‎I have spent all my years

750
01:11:08,055 --> 01:11:10,140
‎at the young master's side.

751
01:11:11,934 --> 01:11:12,810
‎And so

752
01:11:13,560 --> 01:11:16,855
‎if I may presume to read his heart,

753
01:11:22,778 --> 01:11:25,030
‎he would have me bring you
‎a warm cup of tea.

754
01:11:28,742 --> 01:11:30,119
‎I believe he would.

755
01:11:33,831 --> 01:11:35,040
‎Do go inside.

756
01:11:55,477 --> 01:11:56,395
‎Yun!

757
01:12:01,317 --> 01:12:02,484
‎Yun!

758
01:12:08,324 --> 01:12:09,658
‎Yun!

759
01:12:42,941 --> 01:12:45,152
‎I am well.

760
01:12:46,612 --> 01:12:47,780
‎I live

761
01:12:48,989 --> 01:12:50,532
‎much as I always have.

762
01:12:52,076 --> 01:12:52,993
‎Yet,

763
01:12:53,911 --> 01:12:56,372
‎more and more often,

764
01:12:57,164 --> 01:12:59,458
‎I find myself wondering
‎whether you are truly gone.

765
01:13:02,419 --> 01:13:03,379
‎And whenever I do,

766
01:13:04,922 --> 01:13:06,423
‎the same thought comes to me.

767
01:13:08,884 --> 01:13:12,638
‎Had I followed you
‎and left everything behind,

768
01:13:14,306 --> 01:13:15,182
‎I would not

769
01:13:16,433 --> 01:13:19,019
‎have been left with nothing but longing.

770
01:13:23,690 --> 01:13:24,650
‎Dear cousin.

771
01:13:25,401 --> 01:13:26,944
‎If by some chance…

772
01:13:28,987 --> 01:13:30,114
‎you are

773
01:13:31,073 --> 01:13:33,283
‎alive somewhere, living as though dead,

774
01:13:34,827 --> 01:13:37,579
‎would you please come back to me?

775
01:13:39,123 --> 01:13:40,165
‎I remain here,

776
01:13:41,125 --> 01:13:42,209
‎living as though alive,

777
01:13:43,585 --> 01:13:45,462
‎while dying inside.

778
01:17:49,164 --> 01:17:54,169
‎Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song
